flowchart TD
 A[Start] --> B[Upload CSV/Excel or load sample CSV]
 B --> C{Name, RollNo and at least one subject?}
 C -- No --> D[Show validation error]
 D --> B
 C -- Yes --> E[Validate marks 0-100]
 E --> F[Calculate subject average]
 F --> G{Assignment supplied?}
 G -- Yes --> H[Overall average = mean(subject average, assignment)]
 G -- No --> I[Overall average = subject average]
 H --> J[Assign performance category]
 I --> J
 J --> K{Attendance supplied and below threshold OR average below support threshold?}
 K --> L[Flag for human review]
 K --> M[No support flag]
 L --> N[Show dashboard and export reports]
 M --> N
 N --> O[End]
